WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.350
 Why can't you just
leave my daddy alone?

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.480
 Oh, Cassie, this must all
seem like a bunch of confusing

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.090
grown-up stuff to you, huh?

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.130
 Your school has rules, right?

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.640
Like, you can't
draw on the walls.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.130
Well, your daddy went to
Germany and drew on the walls

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.480
with Captain America.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.700
And that was a
violation of Article 16,

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.670
Paragraph 3 of the
Sokovia Accords.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.960
 Cassie, let the man get by.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.430
 But Daddy's super sick.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.580
 I'll see about that.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.550
 He says he doesn't want
anyone else to get sick.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.680
 Well, I'll take
my chances, sweetie.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.930
 He barfed, like a lot.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.400
 Young lady, I'm
a federal agent.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.650
I've seen worse
things than vomit.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:48.460
Like a lot, a lot?

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.520
- Yes!
- Forget it.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.320
Move aside!

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:56.440
 Sir?

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.480
 Can you knock?

00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.650
 Sorry, sir.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.990
But I just got a lead.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:03.310
 Ooh, I love leads.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.910
 Wow, you're really
great with kids.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:09.710
 Thanks.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:10.640
I'm also a youth pastor.

00:01:15.194 --> 00:01:17.098
 How'd you do it, Scott?

00:01:17.098 --> 00:01:19.480
 Do what?

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:21.680
 The card trick.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.763
 Seriously?

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:27.560
 Did you want to grab dinner?

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.770
I mean, 'cause I'm free.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:32.920
[MUSIC PLAYING]

